    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_I5TOVaP6MQ8tap3v",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>PRODUCT DESCRIPTION</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_j0vBXTuA64nrcIQT",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3></h3><ul><li><h3><strong>Benelux:</strong> 1-2 business days</h3></li><li><h3><strong>Europe (outside Benelux):</strong> 2-4 business days</h3></li><li><h3><strong>Outside Europe:</strong> 5-7 business days</h3></li><li><h3><strong>Middle East (outside UAE):</strong> 2-3 business days</h3></li></ul><h3></h3><h3><strong>Free shipping</strong> on orders over €39.</h3><h3></h3><h3>Your order will be processed within 5 hours and shipped from our fulfilment center.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_rf9uv02UkUm3P0vB",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Lio is the flavored air diffuser that makes quitting<strong> simple and enjoyable.</strong> Satisfy cravings and <strong>maintain your hand-to-mouth habit</strong>—anytime, anywhere—<strong>without nicotine, vapor, or smoke</strong>.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_xnMFtAFRYA5gAZbG",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>SHIPPING &amp; DELIVERY</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_jerPqUnbxj0MWhZn",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3></h3><ul><li><h3><strong>Benelux:</strong> 1-2 business days</h3></li><li><h3><strong>Europe (outside Benelux):</strong> 2-4 business days</h3></li><li><h3><strong>Outside Europe:</strong> 5-7 business days</h3></li><li><h3><strong>Middle East (outside UAE):</strong> 2-3 business days</h3></li></ul><h3></h3><h3><strong>Free shipping</strong> on orders over €39.</h3><h3></h3><h3>Your order will be processed within 5 hours and shipped from our fulfilment center.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_CE5sRBogEB7qMRtV",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Lio® is free from nicotine, chemicals, and harmful substances, making it a natural, non-electric option. Since it contains no intoxicants or prohibited ingredients, <strong>Lio® aligns with Halal practices</strong>. However, always consult with a religious authority if you have concerns.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_LjAM8KNn036GLvAg",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>WHAT&apos;S IN A STARTERPACK?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_XDTVqbgpuByCFDXJ",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>LIO® GEN 2 STARTER PACK</strong></h3><h3>1x Lio® Gen 2 – made from stainless steel 1x Lio® Cleaning Kit – to keep your Lio® Gen 2 spotless 1x Lio® Leather Carry Case – for on-the-go convenience 1x Lio® Habit Tracker – to monitor your progress</h3><h3></h3><h3><strong>LIO® CLASSIC STARTER PACK</strong></h3><h3>1x Lio® Classic – crafted from olive or walnut wood 1x Lio® Carry Case – for on-the-go convenience 1x Lio® Habit Tracker – to track your progress</h3><h3></h3><h3>Finally, choose 3, 6, or 9 bags of your favorite flavor Cores. Each bag contains 3 Cores, with each Core lasting 10 days. Three bags give you a full month of refreshing air!</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_o1ZvneJIAoSJxvNH",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>THE SAFEFY AND SCIENCE</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_YiZXehMFEd1N877l",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>Safety first, always</strong>! Every natural plant compound in our products goes through serious third-party testing. These tests (plus a bunch of studies) prove that what you&apos;re inhaling is <strong>safe and effective</strong>. We&apos;re all about research to make sure you get a reliable, natural, non-electric option that keeps you healthy without skimping on safety or results.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_pyLiaTz9Snvn7iyP",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>ARE THE INGREDIENTS IN </h3><h3>THE FLAVOUR CORES NATURAL?</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_bD4rLcU61QpHxM9j",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>You bet! Lio is powered by nature—<strong>no nicotine, smoke, vapor, or harmful chemicals</strong>, just pure goodness. Each Core is medical-grade &amp; soaked in a special blend of pure <strong>essential oils</strong>, sourced from farms across the globe. Think of it as a breath of fresh air, straight from nature’s finest!</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_VCRIod3eEKsOOKxl",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>how Lio® changes lives </p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_o2GW9C2D8FRt0J59",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3><strong>Loved by over 50,000 happy customers.</strong></h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_mA8Oe8pNZqC9FQYm",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Join over 50,000 people worldwide who’ve kicked bad habits naturally with Lio®&apos;s non-electric, nicotine-free technology. Just breathe in flavoured air, infused with natural ingredients, and turn cravings into refreshing moments of relief. Healthy, simple, and always ready.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image_yogFrvZmhY6PCWIy",
      "label": "Image"
    },
    {
      "type": "image_picker",
      "id": "image_yogFrvZmhY6PCWIy_mobile",
      "label": "Image mobile"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_h8LHUc34Pd5UXBaX",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>FREQUENTLY ASKED QUESTIONS</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_5XcP3juGu156Yd34",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<h3>Got questions?  We have answers.</h3>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_V9BZmkrY3PfSDgT4",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p><strong>How does Lio® work?</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_TBl5WH0NZtdEnUO0",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Lio makes quitting your bad habit simple and natural. No chemicals, vapor, or smoke—just fray your Core, breathe, and enjoy. Safe, pocket-sized wellness, anytime, anywhere.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_GLAX2DekcQ2Fih8H",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Is Lio® safe?</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_gNGFe4WVKLXfUzeC",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Safety first! All our plant compounds are third-party tested and proven safe. We’re dedicated to delivering a natural, non-electric solution that keeps your health in mind.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_Mw8s1cW3CvBqXLfO",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p><strong>How long do the flavor Cores last?</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_PCF52PI1cP2JGRgr",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Each Core gives you 2-3 days of use, and every pack comes with 3 Cores. Grab a bundle and you&apos;re set for months of refreshing relaxing moments.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_cXOHYCDs5c37y892",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p><strong>How often can I use Lio®?</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_uK9OxTaRUuNm2ytX",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>As often as you like! Lio® is your go-to whenever cravings strike. And if you ever feel discomfort, just pause and check with your physician.</p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_vgBI4O0Jp7A64jgs",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p><strong>What are Cores made of?</strong></p>"
    },
    {
      "type": "richtext",
      "id": "text_swSwz3AVdEjkp9Vc",
      "label": "Text",
      "default": "<p>Each medical-grade Core is infused with pure essential oils from farms worldwide. It&apos;s like breathing in nature&apos;s finest!</p>"
    },
