        "text_UgAwLzsHYrrHkXXs": "<h3>Imagine satisfying cravings without harmful habits. Lio® offers naturally infused air for guilt-free relief—no chemicals, smoke, vapour, or nicotine. </h3><h3></h3><h3>With <strong>100% natural ingredients</strong>, a <strong>portable design</strong>, and over <strong>50,000 happy customers</strong>, Lio is your natural path to quitting.</h3>",
        "text_LXV7nbdm4CjYgJYI": "<h3>TRUELY BREAK FREE</h3>",
